    "abstract": "<p>Google is on a roll in acquiring rights to offer free full-text searching of priced online journals. It started indexing metadata for Ingenta journal articles in February and added full-text indexing in March. As Ingenta&amp;#39;s Google-visibility rose, its usage rose dramatically. For example, Ingenta had 5.4 million Google-referred users in April alone.</p>",
